      "name": "Black Garlic",
      "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Black garlic is&nbsp;regular white garlic that has been aged in a controlled process of high heat and humidity, causing it to turn black and develop a sweet, savory, and complex flavor.&nbsp;This transformation is not a form of fermentation but a long-term&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=9b26ca4141d495fe&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;sxsrf=AE3TifNNnXTP6UPnRJilYVq56dPUYOxQSQ%3A1764269926438&amp;q=Maillard+reaction&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiGjYPSgZORAxXvFDQIHRSyPGEQxccNegQIJhAB&amp;mstk=AUtExfBIuIEYVZ-wq7tmaX1wP6-YQ1SsOiC8b_PvF9NvH5JX0XLUulef_AI2UeTZggoPV9goOKWVhwsAgJB2Vls1I6oI1m4gk9v_z-Oezrg-TrEmdbVDC9daZGNr1Kh_KYTKmDTUGMEAEF8N7Nw54u8FmbBWrqWpsSyzt-rc_Cx1bNdvskdSAEd-VIpXbljdwXhlr1Rkuu-VXz3UP9yFfexMf0YFiJEvMxSlSF6OHOFIOY0Edlc57-oaJs33h6HE00fgGnp380C-Ddg31JgKn3XEug-y&amp;csui=3\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Maillard reaction</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">,&nbsp;which also softens the texture and reduces the pungent, sulfurous bite of raw garlic.&nbsp;It is often described as having a taste and texture similar to balsamic vinegar or a sweet, chewy date.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>",
